ge_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/12/gym_2_2_269.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/12/gym_2_2_269.jpg"><media:title>Jason Butts coaches the gymnastics team during a meet.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/12/gym_2_2_269.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:08:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>11</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59685</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Take Down Coastal Carolina in Overtime to Advance to Sun Belt Final</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/12/mens-soccer-mountaineers-take-down-coastal-carolina-in-overtime-to-advance-to-sun-belt-final</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/12/mens-soccer-mountaineers-take-down-coastal-carolina-in-overtime-to-advance-to-sun-belt-final</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU Men's Soccer celebrates after defeating Coastal Carolina in overtime" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/12/MSOCvsCoastal_Nov11_2026_AM-36.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 7 and top-seeded West Virginia University men's soccer team defeated No. 5-seed Coastal Carolina, 1-0, in overtime, Wednesday evening at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium. The Mountaineers improve to 12-2-4 overall and advance to Sunday's Sun Belt Championship Final against No. 6-seed South Carolina.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/12/MSOCvsCoastal_Nov11_2026_AM-36.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/12/MSOCvsCoastal_Nov11_2026_AM-36.jpg"><media:title>WVU Men's Soccer celebrates after defeating Coastal Carolina in overtime</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/12/MSOCvsCoastal_Nov11_2026_AM-36.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:16:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59681</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>